        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jGErT",
          "name": "2 Entry points body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "/dashboard after sign-in (AuthLayout redirects signed-in users here). Workspace settings, Share and template picker open as overlays from this page.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fvk6K",
          "name": "3 Screens",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3 Screens",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Omlc0",
          "name": "3 Screens body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Workspace with folders · Workspace without folders · Recent (empty) · Card actions menu. Base frame 1280×800, light theme. The page scrolls; the frame is the first viewport.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C2Rgvn",
          "name": "4 Business rules",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4 Business rules",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gtSia",
          "name": "4 Business rules body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Folder sections and the “New Diagram” card exist only when the workspace has folders (WorkspaceView); without folders GeneralView renders the plain grid and the empty message. “New Workspace” is hidden at 5 non-personal workspaces. Recent = latest 10 by update time. Toolbar shows only in workspace view.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H466iZ",
          "name": "5 Copy source",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5 Copy source",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "D9d37L",
          "name": "5 Copy source body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "pages/Dashboard.tsx, components/dashboard/*, components/DiagramCard.tsx, lib/hooks/useDashboardData.ts. Sample data from db:seed (Admin User; Architecture Overview, Sprint Planning Board, User Flow Diagram); “Planning” and “Untitled” are sample data. Card thumbnails: the no-thumbnail state only.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xLkBw",
          "name": "6 States not drawn",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "6 States not drawn",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yp2T8",
          "name": "6 States not drawn body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Search results, Starred and My Templates views, list view, loading, workspace settings drawer, template picker, share modal (Share flow), dark theme. Dashed borders (New Diagram card, no-thumbnail) are drawn solid: Pencil has no dash. Menu icons are feather equivalents; the email is clipped like the code's truncate.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Qid3F",
          "name": "7 Open findings",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "7 Open findings",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
